      "title": "HTTP/3: Dissect CANCEL_PUSH, PUSH_PROMISE, GOAWAY, and MAX_PUSH_ID frames",
      "message": "HTTP/3: Dissect CANCEL_PUSH, PUSH_PROMISE, GOAWAY, and MAX_PUSH_ID frames\n\nRFC 9114 defines several control frames that previously had empty TODO stubs in dissect_http3_frame:\n\n- CANCEL_PUSH: Dissect the Push ID variable-length integer.\n\n- PUSH_PROMISE: Dissect the Push ID variable-length integer and dissect the embedded header block with dissect_http3_headers.\n\n- GOAWAY: Dissect the Stream ID variable-length integer.\n\n- MAX_PUSH_ID: Dissect the Push ID variable-length integer.\n\nAppend the IDs to the frame item text to provide immediate visibility in the packet tree.\n",
